1
00:00:00,170 --> 00:00:04,170
(Penny:)Okay, sweetie. I'll take care of you.
What do you need?

2
00:00:04,341 --> 00:00:08,841
(Sheldon:)Well, my mom used to give me
sponge baths.

3
00:00:15,227 --> 00:00:16,267
Okay, ground rules:

4
00:00:16,436 --> 00:00:19,986
(Penny:)No sponge baths
and definitely no enemas.

5
00:00:20,399 --> 00:00:22,149
(Sheldon:)Agreed.

6
00:00:26,488 --> 00:00:30,078
(Leonard:)Here we go.
Ten and a half hours of apey goodness.

7
00:00:30,242 --> 00:00:31,782
[THX'S "DEEP NOTE"
PLAYS OVER SPEAKERS]

8
00:00:31,952 --> 00:00:33,242
[GLASSES CLATTER]

9
00:00:33,412 --> 00:00:35,872
Damn it, my glasses.

10
00:00:36,456 --> 00:00:38,916
(Leonard:)Okay, I'm blind here, guys.
Can you help me find them?

11
00:00:39,084 --> 00:00:40,914
(Penny:)- Sorry.
- Okay.

12
00:00:41,837 --> 00:00:43,837
[GLASSES BREAKING]

13
00:00:44,047 --> 00:00:45,257
Found them.

14
00:00:45,424 --> 00:00:46,844
[MUSIC PLAYING OVER SPEAKERS]

15
00:00:47,009 --> 00:00:49,969
- Oh, great.
- I'm sorry. Don't you have a spare?

16
00:00:50,137 --> 00:00:52,767
- Yeah, at home.
- If you leave now, you can be back...

17
00:00:52,931 --> 00:00:56,101
...before the gorillas whip
the crap out of Charlton Heston.

